{"id": "9th-u5-q002", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sculpture-manimekalai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சுண்ணாம்புக் கலவையான 'சுதை புனை பாவை' பற்றிய குறிப்புகள் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள சங்கமருவிய காலக் காப்பியம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சிலப்பதிகாரம்", "B": "மணிமேகலை", "C": "சீவக சிந்தாமணி", "D": "குண்டலகேசி"}, "explanation": "சுண்ணாம்பும் மணலும் சேர்ந்த சுதையினால் உருவங்கள் அமைக்கப்பட்டதை மணிமேகலையில் உள்ள 'சுதை புனை பாவை' என்னும் குறிப்பு உறுதி செய்கிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which post-Sangam Buddhist epic do literary references to 'Sudhai Punai Paavai' (stucco figurines crafted from limestone mortar) appear?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Silappathikaram", "B": "Manimekalai", "C": "Seevaga Chinthamani", "D": "Kundalakesi"}, "explanation": "The epic 'Manimekalai' refers to 'Sudhai Punai Paavai', proving the prevalent art of lime stucco sculptures in ancient Tamil society."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 108, "chapter": null, "sect