{"id": "9th-u5-q040", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tribhuvanam-kampaharesvara", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மூன்றாம் குலோத்துங்க சோழனால் கலைநுட்பத்துடன் கட்டப்பட்ட புகழ்பெற்ற சோழர் காலக் கோயில் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தஞ்சைப் பெரிய கோயில்", "B": "கங்கைகொண்ட சோழபுரம்", "C": "தாராசுரம் ஐராவதீசுவரர் கோயில்", "D": "திரிபுவனம் கம்பகரேசுவரர் கோயில்"}, "explanation": "கும்பகோணம் அருகே திரிபுவனத்தில் அமைந்துள்ள 'கம்பகரேசுவரர் கோயில்' மூன்றாம் குலோத்துங்க சோழனால் சிற்பக் கலைநயத்துடன் கட்டப்பட்ட பிற்காலச் சோழர் கோயிலாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which celebrated later Chola temple was erected by Kulothunga Chola III showcasing refined stone craft?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Thanjavur Brihadisvara Temple", "B": "Gangaikonda Cholapuram", "C": "Darasuram Airavatesvara Temple", "D": "Tribhuvanam Kampaharesvara Temple"}, "explanation": "Kampaharesvara Temple at Tribhuvanam was built by Kulothunga Chola III, marking the final monumental phase of Chola architecture."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 111, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 111", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_5", "sculpture", "cholas"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u5-q041", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multi_statement", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "chola-sculptures-analysis", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சோழர் காலச் சிற்பக்கலை குறித்த பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. சோழர் காலம் செப்புத் திருமேனிகளின் பொற்காலம் என்று அழைக்கப்படுகிறது.\n2. தாராசுரம் ஐராவதீசுவரர் கோயிலில் 63 நாயன்மார்களின் கதைகள் புடைப்புச் சிற்பங்களாக உள்ளன.\n3. தஞ்சைப் பெரிய கோயிலின் விமானத்தின் உச்சியில் உள்ள ஒற்றைக்கல் 80 டன் எடை கொண்டது.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2, 3 ஆகிய அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "1 மற்றும் 2 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "2 மற்றும் 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1 மற்றும் 3 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "மூன்று கூற்றுகளும் வரலாற்று உண்மைகள்: சோழர் காலம் செப்புத் திருமேனிகளின் பொற்காலம்; தாராசுரத்தில் 63 நாயன்மார் சிற்பங்கள் உள்ளன; தஞ்சை விமான உச்சிக்கல் 80 டன் எடை கொண்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the following statements regarding Chola sculpture:\n1. The Chola era is hailed as the Golden Age of Bronze Icons.\n2. Darasuram Airavatesvara Temple features relief panels depicting the hagiography of 63 Nayanmars.\n3. The monolithic cupolic block atop Thanjavur Big Temple weighs 80 tonnes.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All 1, 2, and 3 are correct", "B": "1 and 2 only are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "1 and 3 only are correct"}, "explanation": "All three statements are factually authentic depictions of Chola sculptural and structural engineering."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 110, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 110", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_5", "sculpture", "multi_statement"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u5-q042", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "madurai-meenakshi-sculptures", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மதுரை மீனாட்சி சுந்தரேசுவரர் கோயிலில் உள்ள ஆயிரங்கால் மண்டபத்தையும் புதுமண்டபத்தையும் அமைத்த பெருமை யாருக்குரியது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பல்லவர்கள்", "B": "நாயக்க மன்னர்கள் (திருமலை நாயக்கர் உள்ளிட்டோர்)", "C": "சோழர்கள்", "D": "சேரர்கள்"}, "explanation": "மதுரை மீனாட்சி அம்மன் கோயிலின் ஆயிரங்கால் மண்டபம் மற்றும் புதுமண்டபத்தை அமைத்து, அவற்றில் மீனாட்சி கல்யாணம், குறவன்-குறத்தி போன்ற ஒப்பற்ற சிற்பங்களை வடித்தவர்கள் நாயக்க மன்னர்கள் ஆவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To whom does the historical credit of erecting the magnificent Thousand-Pillared Hall and Pudumandapam at Madurai Meenakshi Temple belong?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Pallavas", "B": "Nayak rulers (including Thirumalai Nayak)", "C": "Cholas", "D": "Cheras"}, "explanation": "Nayak rulers constructed the famed Pudumandapam and Thousand-Pillared Hall at Madurai Meenakshi Temple."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 111, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 111", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_5", "sculpture", "madurai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u5-q043", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "dindigul-thadikombu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திண்டுக்கல் அருகே உள்ள எந்தக் கோயிலில் ரதி, மன்மதன் உருவங்கள் மிக நேர்த்தியான சிற்பங்களாக வடிக்கப்பட்டுள்ளன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பழனி முருகன் கோயில்", "B": "வத்தலக்குண்டு காசி விசுவநாதர் கோயில்", "C": "தாடிக்கொம்பு சௌந்தரராஜப் பெருமாள் கோயில்", "D": "ஆத்தூர் சோமேசுவரர் கோயில்"}, "explanation": "திண்டுக்கல் அருகே உள்ள தாடிக்கொம்பு சௌந்தரராஜப் பெருமாள் கோயிலில் நாயக்கர் காலச் சிற்பக்கலையின் மாட்சியான ரதி-மன்மதன் உள்ளிட்ட மிக நுணுக்கமான தூண் சிற்பங்கள் அமைந்துள்ளன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "At which temple near Dindigul are the celebrated detailed Nayak stone figures of Rati and Manmatha carved?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Palani Murugan Temple", "B": "Vathalagundu Viswanathar Temple", "C": "Thadikombu Soundararaja Perumal Temple", "D": "Athoor Someswarar Temple"}, "explanation": "Thadikombu Soundararaja Perumal Temple near Dindigul is famous for its intricate Nayak carvings of Rati and Manmatha."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educati