{"id": "9th-u5-q094", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multi_statement", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "janakiraman-works-analysis", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தி. ஜானகிராமன் பற்றிய பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. இவரது 'சக்தி வைத்தியம்' என்னும் சிறுகதைத் தொகுப்பிற்கு சாகித்திய அகாதெமி விருது கிடைத்தது.\n2. காவிரி படுகைப் பயணத்தை 'நடந்தாய் வாழி காவேரி' என்னும் தலைப்பில் சிட்டியுடன் இணைந்து எழுதினார்.\n3. இவர் கரிசல் இலக்கியத்தின் தந்தை என்று அழைக்கப்படுகிறார்.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2, 3 ஆகிய அனைத்தும் சரி", "B": "1 மற்றும் 2 மட்டும் சரி", "C": "2 மற்றும் 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1 மற்றும் 3 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று 3 தவறானது. கரிசல் இலக்கியத்தின் தந்தை என்று அழைக்கப்படுபவர் கி. ராஜநாராயணன் (கி.ரா) ஆவார். தி. ஜானகிராமன் தஞ்சை வட்டார எழுத்தாளர். கூற்றுகள் 1 மற்றும் 2 முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements regarding T. Janakiraman:\n1. His anthology 'Sakthi Vaithiyam' won the Sahitya Akademi Award.\n2. He co-authored 'Nadandhaai Vaazhi Kaveri' with Chitti tracing the Cauvery basin.\n3. He is acclaimed as the father of Karisal literature.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "All 1, 2, and 3 are correct", "B": "1 and 2 only are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "1 and 3 only are correct"}, "explanation": "Statement 3 is false as Ki. Rajanarayanan is the father of Karisal literature; Janakiraman represents Thanjavur. Statements 1 and 2 are true."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 121, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 121", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_5", "janakiraman", "multi_statement"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u5-q095", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "janakiraman-travelogues-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (தி. ஜானகிராமனின் பயண நூல்கள் - களம்):\n(a) நடந்தாய் வாழி காவேரி - 1. உருமேனியா\n(b) அடுத்த வீடு ஐம்பது மைல் - 2. காவிரி படுகை\n(c) கருங்கடலும் கலைக்கடலும் - 3. செக்கோஸ்லோவாக்கியா", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-3, (c)-2", "B": "(a)-3, (b)-2, (c)-1", "C": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-1", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-3"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்: நடந்தாய் வாழி காவேரி - காவிரி படுகைப் பயணம் (2); அடுத்த வீடு ஐம்பது மைல் - செக்கோஸ்லோவாக்கியா பயணம் (3); கருங்கடலும் கலைக்கடலும் - உருமேனியப் பயணம் (1)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match T. Janakiraman's travelogues with their regions:\n(a) Nadandhaai Vaazhi Kaveri - 1. Romania\n(b) Adutha Veedu Aimbathu Mile - 2. Cauvery River basin\n(c) Karunkadalum Kalaikkadalum - 3. Czechoslovakia", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-3, (c)-2", "B": "(a)-3, (b)-2, (c)-1", "C": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-1", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-3"}, "explanation": "Accurate mapping: Nadandhaai Vaazhi Kaveri = Cauvery (2); Adutha Veedu Aimbathu Mile = Czechoslovakia (3); Karunkadalum Kalaikkadalum = Romania (1)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 121, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 121", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_5", "janakiraman", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u5-q096", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "seidhai-story-message", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'செய்தி' கதையில் இசைக் கலைஞர் தன் நாதசுவரத்தின் வழியே எதனைப் பிறருக்குக் கடத்துகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அரசியல் கருத்துகளை", "B": "கோபத்தை", "C": "பண ஆசையை", "D": "மனித உணர்வுகளின் மேன்மையையும் ஆன்ம நேயச் செய்தியையும்"}, "explanation": "இசை என்பது வெறும் பொழுதுபோக்கன்று, அது மனித உள்ளத்தின் ஆழமான உணர்வுகளையும், அன்பையும், தூய கலை அமைதியையும் பிறருக்குக் கடத்தும் 'செய்தி' என்பதை இக்கதை உணர்த்துகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the story 'Seidhi', what sublime transmission does the maestro deliver through the notes of his Nadaswaram?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Partisan political views", "B": "Anger and bitterness", "C": "Greed for lucre", "D": "The spiritual transcendence of human emotion and soul communion"}, "explanation": "The story elucidates that supreme art is an ontological 'message' communicating cosmic harmony and emotional purity."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "t