{"id": "9th-u5-q099", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "seidhai-assertion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): 'செய்தி' சிறுகதையில் இசை என்பது சொற்களைக் கடந்த பேரமைதி கொண்ட மொழியாகக் காட்டப்படுகிறது.\nகாரணம் (R): ஒரு சிறந்த கலைப்படைப்பு எவ்வித மொழி எல்லையுமின்றி மனித இதயங்களை நேருக்கு நேர் பேச வைக்கிறது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) சரி, ஆனால் (R) தவறு", "B": "(A) தவறு, ஆனால் (R) சரி", "C": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; மேலும் (R) என்பது (A) விற்கு சரியான விளக்கம்", "D": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "இசை மொழிகளைக் கடந்து அனைத்து மனித உள்ளங்களையும் ஒன்றிணைக்கும் ஆற்றல் படைத்தது என்பதே இக்கதையின் தத்துவமாகும். கூற்று, காரணம் இரண்டும் சரி, பொருத்தமான விளக்கமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): In 'Seidhi', music is portrayed as a transcendent language beyond spoken words.\nReason (R): Great art dissolves all linguistic barriers, establishing direct communion between human souls.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) is true, but (R) is false", "B": "(A) is false, but (R) is true", "C": "Both (A) and (R) are true, and (R) is the correct explanation of (A)", "D": "Both (A) and (R) are false"}, "explanation": "Both assertion and reason are true and harmoniously aligned with Janakiraman's artistic philosophy."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 118, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 118", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_5", "seidhi", "assertion_reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
