{"id": "9th-u5-q104", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "janakiraman-playwright", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தி. ஜானகிராமன் நாவல்கள், சிறுகதைகள் தவிர வேறு எந்த இலக்கிய வடிவங்களிலும் முத்திரை பதித்துள்ளார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஹைக்கூ கவிதைகள்", "B": "மடல் இலக்கியம்", "C": "கப்பல் சாத்திரம்", "D": "நாடகங்கள் மற்றும் பயண இலக்கியங்கள்"}, "explanation": "தி. ஜானகிராமன் சிறுகதை, நாவல் மட்டுமின்றி 'நாலு வேலி நிலம்', 'வடிவேலு வாத்தியார்' போன்ற புகழ்பெற்ற நாடகங்களையும் பயண இலக்கியங்களையும் படைத்துள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Besides novels and short stories, in which other genres did T. Janakiraman leave a lasting creative mark?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Haiku poetry", "B": "Epistolary epics", "C": "Naval architecture treatises", "D": "Stage plays and travel writing"}, "explanation": "Janakiraman penned successful stage plays like 'Naalu Veli Nilam' along with landmark travelogues."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 121, "chapter": null, "se