{"id": "9th-u5-q105", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "janakiraman-thanjavur-trio", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் இலக்கிய உலகில் 'தஞ்சை எழுத்தாளர்கள்' வரிசையில் கு. அழகிரிசாமி, கரிச்சான் குஞ்சு ஆகியோருடன் முதன்மையாக வைத்துப் போற்றப்படும் எழுத்தாளர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தி. ஜானகிராமன்", "B": "ஜெயகாந்தன்", "C": "அசோகமித்திரன்", "D": "சுஜாதா"}, "explanation": "தஞ்சை இலக்கிய வட்டத்தின் முன்னோடிகளில் கு. அழகிரிசாமி, கரிச்சான் குஞ்சு, ந. பிச்சமூர்த்தி ஆகியோருடன் தி. ஜானகிராமன் தனித்துவமான பீடம் வகிக்கிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which luminary is prominently revered among the galaxy of Thanjavur writers alongside Ku. Alagirisamy and Karichan Kunju?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "T. Janakiraman", "B": "Jayakanthan", "C": "Ashokamitran", "D": "Sujatha"}, "explanation": "T. Janakiraman stands as the foremost giant of modern Thanjavur literary writing."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 121, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": 