{"id": "9th-u5-q118", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vallinam-vinaiechcham-i", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "எந்த எழுத்தில் முடியும் வினையெச்சங்களை அடுத்து வல்லினம் கண்டிப்பாக மிகும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அகர ஈற்று வினையெச்சம்", "B": "இகர ஈற்று வினையெச்சம் (எழுதி, ஓடி போன்றவை)", "C": "ஐகார ஈற்று வினையெச்சம்", "D": "ஔகார ஈற்று வினையெச்சம்"}, "explanation": "இகரத்தில் முடியும் வினையெச்சங்களை அடுத்து வரும் க், ச், த், ப் மிகும். எ.கா: எழுதி + பார்த்தான் = எழுதிப் பார்த்தான்; ஓடி + களைத்தான் = ஓடிக் களைத்தான்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Following verbal participles ending in which vowel does plosive doubling obligatorily occur?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "'a'-ending participles", "B": "'i'-ending participles (e.g., ezhudhi, odi)", "C": "'ai'-ending participles", "D": "'au'-ending participles"}, "explanation": "Verbal participles terminating in '-i' (e.g., ezhudhi + paarthaan = ezhudhip paarthaan) trigger mandatory plosive gemination."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "editio