{"id": "9th-u5-q125", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vallinam-ena-aaga", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'என, ஆக' போன்ற இடைச்சொற்களுக்குப் பின் வல்லினம் என்னவாகும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வல்லினம் மிகும் (எனக் கூறினான், வருவதாகச் சொன்னான்)", "B": "வல்லினம் மிகாது", "C": "எந்த மாற்றமும் ஏற்படாது", "D": "மெல்லினமாகத் திரியும்"}, "explanation": "'என', 'ஆக' என்னும் இடைச்சொற்களை அடுத்து வரும் வல்லினம் கண்டிப்பாக மிகும். எ.கா: என + கூறினான் = எனக் கூறினான்; வருவதாக + சொன்னான் = வருவதாகச் சொன்னான்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What happens when plosive stops follow the conjunctive particles 'Ena' and 'Aaga'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Plosives obligatorily double (Enak koorinaan, Varuvadhaagach chonnaan)", "B": "Plosives do not double", "C": "No modification", "D": "Mutates to nasals"}, "explanation": "Particles 'ena' and 'aaga' consistently trigger hard consonant doubling."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 130, "chapter": null, "section": null, "refe