{"id": "9th-u5-q133", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vallinam-assertion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): தமிழ் உரைநடையில் வல்லினம் மிகும் இடங்களை அறிந்து எழுதுவது இன்றியமையாதது.\nகாரணம் (R): வல்லின மெய்களைத் தேவையின்றி இடுவதோ, தேவையான இடங்களில் இடாமல் விடுவதோ சொல்லின் பொருளையே தலைகீழாக மாற்றிவிடும்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; மேலும் (R) என்பது (A) விற்கு சரியான விளக்கம்", "B": "(A) சரி, ஆனால் (R) தவறு", "C": "(A) தவறு, ஆனால் (R) சரி", "D": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "வல்லினம் இடுவதும் விடுப்பதும் பொருளை மாற்றும் தன்மை கொண்டதால், இலக்கண விதிகளை அறிந்து எழுதுவது இன்றியமையாதது. கூற்று, காரணம் இரண்டும் சரி, தக்க விளக்கமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Mastering the rules of hard consonant doubling is indispensable in written Tamil prose.\nReason (R): Omission or erroneous addition of plosive stops radically alters the intended semantic meaning.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both (A) and (R) are true, and (R) is the correct explanation of (A)", "B": "(A) is true, but (R) is false", "C": "(A) is false, but (R) is true", "D": "Both (A) and (R) are false"}, "explanation": "Both assertion and reason are true; accurate sandhi execution protects prose from drastic semantic shifts."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 129, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 129", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_5", "grammar", "assertion_reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u5-q134", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vallinam-thirukkural-example", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'திருக்குறள்' என்னும் சொல்லில் நிலைமொழிக்கும் வருமொழிக்கும் இடையே 'க்' மிகுந்துள்ளதற்கான இலக்கண விதி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உவமைத்தொகையில் வல்லினம் மிகும்", "B": "முற்றியலுகரச் சொல்லின் பின் வல்லினம் மிகும்", "C": "இரண்டாம் வேற்றுமை உருபின் பின் வல்லினம் மிகும்", "D": "திசைப் பெயரின் பின் வல்லினம் மிகும்"}, "explanation": "'திரு' என்பது முற்றியலுகரச் சொல்லாகும். முற்றியலுகரச் சொற்களுக்குப் பின் வரும் வல்லினம் மிகும் என்ற விதியின்படி திரு + குறள் = திருக்குறள் என்றானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Under which grammatical rule does 'k' double in the compound 'Thirukkural' (Thiru + kural)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Simile compound rule", "B": "Plosives double following a Mutriyalugaram stem", "C": "Accusative case expansion rule", "D": "Directional noun rule"}, "explanation": "'Thiru' is a Mutriyalugaram base, triggering mandatory plosive doubling."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "clas