{"id": "9th-u5-q141", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kural-uzhavu-suzhantrum", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"சுழன்றும்ஏர்ப் பின்னது உலகம் அதனால் / உழந்தும் __________ தலை\" - திருக்குறளின் விடுபட்ட சீர் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உழவே", "B": "அறமே", "C": "பொருளே", "D": "வளமே"}, "explanation": "'சுழன்றும்ஏர்ப் பின்னது உலகம் அதனால் / உழந்தும் உழவே தலை' (குறள் 1031). பல தொழில்களால் உலகம் சுழன்று இயங்கினாலும் ஏர்த்தொழிலின் பின்னாலேயே இயங்க வேண்டும்; அதனால் எவ்வளவு துன்புற்றாலும் உழவுத்தொழிலே முதன்மையானதாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"Suzhandrumeyrp pinnadhu ulagam adhanaal / Uzhandhum __________ thalai\" - Identify the missing word in this Kural couplet.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uzhave (உழவே - Agriculture)", "B": "Arame", "C": "Porule", "D": "Valame"}, "explanation": "Kural 1031 declares that though the world roams through many pursuits, it must ultimately follow the plow; hence agriculture is supreme."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 127, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 127", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_5", "thirukkural", "uzhavu"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u5-q142", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kural-uzhudhundu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"உழுதுண்டு வாழ்வாரே வாழ்வார்மற் றெல்லாம் / தொழுதுண்டு பின்செல் பவர்\" - இக்குறள் உணர்த்தும் கருத்து யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வணிகத்தின் பெருமை", "B": "உழவு செய்து வாழ்பவர்களே தற்சார்புடன் வாழ்பவர்கள்; மற்றவர் எல்லாரும் அவர்களை வணங்கி உண்பவர்கள்", "C": "அரசனின் கடமை", "D": "கல்வியின் சிறப்பு"}, "explanation": "உழவுத் தொழில் செய்து வாழ்பவர்களே உண்மையான உரிமை வாழ்வு வாழ்பவர்கள். ஏனைய தொழில்களைச் செய்பவர்கள் எல்லாரும் உழவர்களை வணங்கி, அவர்கள் தரும் உணவிற்காக அவர்களைப் பின்செல்பவர்கள் ஆவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"Uzhudhundu vaazhvaare vaazhvaarmat rellaam / Thozhudhundu pinsel bavar\" - What fundamental economic reality is expounded in this Kural?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Glory of maritime trade", "B": "Only those who till the soil live independent lives; all others follow and depend on them for subsistence", "C": "Duties of monarch", "D": "Eminence of education"}, "explanation": "Thiruvalluvar affirms that farmers are truly sovereign because all other strata of society depend on their agricultural labor for sustenance."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 127, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 127", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_5", "thirukkural", "uzhavu"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u5-q143", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kural-saanraanmai-pillars", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"அன்புநாண் ஒப்புரவு கண்ணோட்டம் வாய்மையோடு / ஐந்துசால்பு ஊன்றிய தூண்\" - இக்குறளில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள அணி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உவமை அணி", "B": "சொற்பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி", "C": "ஏகதேச உருவக அணி", "D": "வேற்றுமை அணி"}, "explanation": "சான்றாண்மை என்னும் மாளிகையைத் தாங்கும் தூண்களாக அன்பு, நாண், ஒப்புரவு, கண்ணோட்டம், வாய்மை ஆகிய ஐந்தையும் உருவகம் செய்து, சான்றாண்மையை வெளிப்படையாக உருவகம் செய்யாமல் விட்டதால் இது 'ஏகதேச உருவக அணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What rhetorical figure of speech (Ani) is deployed in the couplet 'Anbunaan oppuravu kannottam vaaimaiyodu / Aindhusaalbu oondriya thoon'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uvamai Ani (Simile)", "B": "Solporul Pinvarunilai Ani", "C": "Ekadhesa Uruvaga Ani (Partial Metaphor)", "D": "Vaetrumai Ani"}, "explanation": "By metaphorizing five virtues into pillars supporting nobility without explicitly metaphorizing nobility into a palace edifice, it exemplifies Ekadhesa Uruvaga Ani."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 126, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 126", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_5", "thirukkural", "ani"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u5-q144", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kural-nanudaimai-specialty", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"ஊண்உடை எச்சம் உயிர்க்கெல்லாம் வேறல்ல / நாண்உடைமை மாந்தர் சிறப்பு\" - வள்ளுவர் கூற்றுப்படி விலங்கினங்களிலிருந்து மனிதனைப் பிரித்துக் காட்டும் தனிச்சிறப்பு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உணவு உண்பது", "B": "ஆடை அணிவது", "C": "உறங்குவது", "D": "தீய செயல்களுக்கு அஞ்சி நாணுதல் (நாணுடைமை)"}, "explanation": "உணவு, உடை, இனப்பெருக்கம் போன்ற உடலியல் தேவைகள் எல்லா உயிர்களுக்கும் பொதுவானவை. ஆனால் பழி பாவங்களுக்கு அஞ்சி வெட்கப்படும் 'நாணுடைமையே' மனிதனின் உயரிய தனிச்சிறப்பாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Valluvar in Kural 1012, what unique moral virtue fundamentally distinguishes human beings from other animals?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Partaking of food", "B": "Dressing in clothes", "C": "Sleeping", "D": "Sense of moral shame (Naanudaimai) towards reprehensible actions"}, "explanation": "Kural 1012 declares that while food and shelter are common to all biological organisms, the sense of shame (Naan) is the hallmark of human dignity."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 127, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 127", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_5", "thirukkural", "nanudaimai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u5-q145", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kural-kudimai-kodi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"அடுக்கிய கோடி பெறினும் குடிப்பிறந்தார் / குன்றுவ செய்தல் இலர்\" - இக்குறள் உணர்த்தும் நெறி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கோடிப் பொருள் கிடைப்பினும் உயர்ந்த குடியில் பிறந்தோர் தன் குடிப்பெருமைக்குக் கேடான இழிசெயலைச் செய்யார்", "B": "பணமே முதன்மையானது", "C": "குடிப்பிறப்பு தவறானது", "D": "கோடீசுவரர்கள் தானம் செய்ய வேண்டும்"}, "explanation": "பல கோடிக் கணக்கான பொருள்களைப் பெறுவதாக இருந்தாலும், பண்பட்ட உயர்ந்த குடியில் பிறந்தவர்கள் தம் குடிப்பெருமையைக் குறைக்கும் இழிவான செயல்களை ஒருபோதும் செய்ய மாட்டார்கள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"Adukkiya kodi perinnum kudippirandhaar / Kundruva seidhal ilar\" - What ethical principle does this verse affirm?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Even if offered heaped crores of wealth, noble-born souls will never commit dishonorable deeds compromising their dignity", "B": "Material wealth is supreme", "C": "Noble lineage is irrelevant", "D": "Billionaires must donate"}, "explanation": "Noble character refuses to stoop to demeaning or corrupt deeds regardless of astronomical financial enticement."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers