{"id": "9th-u5-q149", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "glossary-matching-iyal5", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (கலைச்சொற்கள்):\n(a) Honorary Doctorate - 1. மதிப்புறு முனைவர்\n(b) Melody - 2. மெல்லிசை\n(c) Documentary Film - 3. ஆவணக் குறும்படம்\n(d) Sentence - 4. சொற்றொடர்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்: Honorary Doctorate - மதிப்புறு முனைவர்; Melody - மெல்லிசை; Documentary Film - ஆவணக் குறும்படம்; Sentence - சொற்றொடர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the English terms with their Tamil glossary equivalents:\n(a) Honorary Doctorate - 1. Madhippu-ru Munaivar\n(b) Melody - 2. Mellisai\n(c) Documentary Film - 3. Aavanak Kurumpadam\n(d) Sentence - 4. Sottrodar", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "Accurate mapping: Honorary Doctorate = Madhippu-ru Munaivar; Melody = Mellisai; Documentary Film = Aavanak Kurumpadam; Sentence = Sottrodar."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_m