{"id": "9th-u5-q150", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kural-igal-pagaivar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"இகல்என்ப எல்லா உயிர்க்கும் பகல்என்னும் / பண்பின்மை பாரிக்கும் நோய்\" - இதில் 'பகல்' என்பதன் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பகல் பொழுது (Daytime)", "B": "பிரிவு / பிளவுபடுத்தல்", "C": "வெளிச்சம்", "D": "சூரியன்"}, "explanation": "இக்குறளில் 'பகல்' என்பது பகல் பொழுதைக் குறிக்காது; உயிர்களை ஒன்றோடொன்று சேரவிடாமல் 'பிளவுபடுத்திப் பிரித்து வைக்கும்' தன்மையைக் குறிக்கிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Kural 851, what does the archaic term 'Pagal' in 'Pagalennum panbinmai paarikkum noi' semantically denote?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Daytime sunshine", "B": "Division / Alienating estrangement", "C": "Light", "D": "Sun"}, "explanation": "'Pagal' here denotes division and alienation that drives people apart."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 126, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 126", "url": null, "s